From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:43:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Trabis: attach the purchase invoice to a Ratenkauf (upload or
 photo)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Ratenkauf dialog: optional invoice (PDF/photo, upload or camera).
- Stored like every receipt on the first payment (IndexedDB, tx.receiptId), so it
  appears with the month's Belege, opens in the receipt viewer and goes into the
  accountant package.
- Plan card: "Rechnung" to open it, or "Rechnung hinzufügen" to add it later.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 9.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WrSmbPeJ9qpSAgv9M15c7v
